{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:17.273640+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Yes, I know about this and it is intentional. This requires adding uneven sharding support and I haven't gotten around to it yet.","created_at":"2022-12-14T21:31:55Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632#issuecomment-1352233681","id":1352233681,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5QmXLR","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1352233681/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-12-14T21:31:55Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1352233681","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I don't think what I am talking about is uneven sharding, but please excuse me if I am misunderstanding.\r\n\r\nIn the case I present here I have a matrix that is sharded (evenly) along axis 1. \r\nIf I index the matrix along axis 0, I'd expect to obtain a vector that is sharded (evenly) along it's only axis.\r\n\r\nThe MWE shows that this works correctly when you index inside jit, but fails when you index outside a jit context. This can also be seen because if you index the axis 0 (which is not sharded) with the `.at[..].get()` syntax, this gives the correct result, probably because you automatically jit this kind of syntax?\r\n\r\n```python\r\n# good sharding by using .at[..].get syntax\r\nIn [13]: x.at[0].get().sharding\r\nOut[13]: OpShardingSharding({devices=[4]0,1,2,3})\r\n\r\n# bad sharing by indexing outside of jit\r\nIn [14]: x[0].sharding\r\nOut[14]: SingleDeviceSharding(device=CpuDevice(id=0))\r\n\r\n# good sharding by indexing inside of jit\r\nIn [15]: jax.jit(lambda x,i:x[i])(x,0).sharding\r\nOut[15]: OpShardingSharding({devices=[4]0,1,2,3})\r\n```\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2022-12-15T12:23:39Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632#issuecomment-1352985240","id":1352985240,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5QpOqY","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1352985240/reactions"},"updated_at":"2022-12-15T12:27:12Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1352985240","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2407108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipVinc","id":2407108,"login":"PhilipVinc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDcxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc","user_view_type":"public"}},{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"Hi @PhilipVinc \r\n\r\nI tried to reproduce this issue with latest version of JAX 0.4.23 on Colab (CPU). The sharding is preserved correctly both inside and outside of the `jax.jit` context.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport os\r\nos.environ[\"XLA_FLAGS\"]=\"--xla_force_host_platform_device_count=4\"\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax.sharding import PositionalSharding\r\n\r\n\r\nprint(jax.__version__)\r\n\r\ndevices = jax.devices()\r\nsharding = PositionalSharding(devices)\r\n\r\nx = jax.device_put(jnp.ones((16,16)), sharding.reshape(1,-1))\r\n\r\nprint(x.sharding)\r\n\r\nprint(x[0].sharding)\r\n\r\nprint(x[1].sharding)\r\n\r\nprint(jax.jit(lambda x: x[0])(x).sharding)\r\n\r\nprint(jax.jit(lambda x: x[1])(x).sharding)\r\n```\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\n0.4.23\r\nPositionalSharding([[{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}]])\r\nPositionalSharding([{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}])\r\nPositionalSharding([{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}])\r\nPositionalSharding([{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}])\r\nPositionalSharding([{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}])\r\n```\r\n\r\nPlease find the [gist](https://colab.research.google.com/gist/rajasekharporeddy/140c47a08c3c0a088ba84026c6a07f48/-13632.ipynb) for reference.\r\n\r\nThank you.","created_at":"2024-02-05T14:32:41Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632#issuecomment-1927138416","id":1927138416,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc5y3cxw","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1927138416/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-02-05T14:32:41Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1927138416","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153593711?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rajasekharporeddy","id":153593711,"login":"rajasekharporeddy","node_id":"U_kgDOCSenbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\r\n\r\nWhen I have an array sharded across a dimension that is not the first, indexing outside of a `jax.jit` context does not preserve the correct sharding.\r\nThe sharding is correctly preserved inside of a jax.jit context. \r\nIt's unfortunate as this breaks the `jit`-invariance of jax even though numerically results will be equivalent.\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport os\r\nos.environ[\"XLA_FLAGS\"]=\"--xla_force_host_platform_device_count=4\"\r\nimport jax\r\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\r\nfrom jax.sharding import PositionalSharding\r\n\r\ndevices = jax.devices()\r\nsharding = PositionalSharding(devices)\r\n\r\nx = jax.device_put(jnp.ones((16,16)), sharding.reshape(1,-1))\r\n\r\nx.sharding\r\nOut[59]: PositionalSharding([[{CPU 0} {CPU 1} {CPU 2} {CPU 3}]])\r\n\r\nx[0].sharding\r\nOut[60]: SingleDeviceSharding(device=CpuDevice(id=0))\r\nx[1].sharding\r\nOut[61]: SingleDeviceSharding(device=CpuDevice(id=0))\r\n\r\njax.jit(lambda x: x[0])(x).sharding\r\nOut[63]: OpShardingSharding({devices=[4]0,1,2,3})\r\njax.jit(lambda x: x[1])(x).sharding\r\nOut[65]: OpShardingSharding({devices=[4]0,1,2,3})\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\njax v0.4.0\r\n\r\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\r\n\r\nCPU\r\n\r\n### Additional system info\r\n\r\nMacOs\r\n\r\n### NVIDIA GPU info\r\n\r\n_No response_","closed_at":"2025-07-22T22:22:04Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2407108?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/PhilipVinc","id":2407108,"login":"PhilipVinc","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MDcxMDg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PhilipVinc","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":3,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/13632/comments","created_at":"2022-12-13T11:26:01Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/136